			"notes": "**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/CobraGamingSj/MoreOres-1.21.11/compare/v7.0+1.21.11-beta.2.3...7.0+1.21.11-beta.2.4\n\nor\n\n## Block Changes\n\n* Added a texture for the Crimson Garnet Block.\n\n### Fixes\n\n* Fixed crystallized gemstone blocks not being mineable.\n* Fixed a bug that could cause the server to crash when right-clicking the Gem Crystallizer.\n\n### Gem Crystallizer\n\n* Added tray textures to improve the block's appearance.\n\n---\n\n## Item Changes\n\n### Radiant Armor\n\nWhen wearing a full set of Radiant Armor, you will receive:\n\n* Health Boost X (infinite duration)\n* Regeneration III (infinite duration)\n\n#### Feather Fall Ability\n\nWhile falling from a height of 5 blocks or more:\n\n* You will automatically receive the Slow Falling effect.\n* The effect duration scales with your fall distance.\n* Your Radiant Boots will take a small amount of durability damage each time the ability activates."
